[[Dante Vale]] learned the Copykind spell from [[Master Storm]] in [[China]] and, after using it to borrow the power of teleportation from [[Umbra]], used the spell in the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]] to gain [[Ignatius]]' ability to control fire and defeat [[Tantras]] and [[Antedeluvian|Powerbonded Antedeluvian]]. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}

[[Dante Vale]] used Copykind whilst fighting [[Rassimov]] to replicate his [[Stormflare]] spell, blasting him at point-blank range. He was later forced to use the spell on [[Maelstrom]] in order to absorb the [[Red Comet]] and stopping it from hitting earth, albeit sacrificing himself. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

Upon his resurrection, Dante revealed he had used Copykind on [[Phoenix]] at the last second, copying its rebirth ability and returning for a final showdown against [[the Betrayer]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

